<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Mirvac sets 5.65 cents distribution.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Mirvac sets 5.65 cents distribution.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mirvac Property Trust (MPT) on Monday confirmed a distribution of 5.65 cents per unit for the half year to December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>The distribution, 25 percent tax free/tax deferred, delivered a total six month return to unitholders of 20.5 percent, it said.</p>
<p>General manager Rob Hattersley said the trust was on track to meet its 1996/97 forecast distribution of 11.4 cents per unit. Total revenue across the portfolio for the half year rose 3.8 percent to A$27.3 million.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
